{
  "$comment": "Austria's setup records (ADR-0169, country-as-data step 3): the building classification under OIB-RL 2 (2023), the facts a project's setup asks with the Bundesländer and the address register that places a site, and the documents that settle a fact. Proposed through records-propose in one change request for AT, reviewed and published like any platform change; never seeded, and the build ships none of it: setup, classification and site placement read the released records and answer 'not yet published' until this is published. Each record cites a capture of that change request with a quote before it can be proposed (ADR-0170, KC-6): the file holds the records, not their captures. The AT territory with its time zone (Europe/Vienna) is the AT record of at.json. Edit the records here, not a generator.",
